      "claim": "The minimum cross-sectional diameter of an adult human skull is larger than the maximum diameter of the human birth canal.",
      "evidence": "The biparietal diameter of an adult skull is approximately 14-15 cm, while the anteroposterior diameter of the pelvic inlet is approximately 11-12 cm and the transverse diameter is approximately 12-13 cm. Even the narrowest part of the adult skull exceeds the widest part of the pelvic inlet.",
